{
  "description": "A Micro feature whose code commit is wholly inside the territory its mini-spec declares. The PASS line states the file count AND where the declaration came from: 'Micro territory from spec.md' is the only thing in the output that distinguishes a lane whose declaration lives somewhere else entirely.",
